{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Propagate JVM-fatal failures immediately.** After an end hook throws `VirtualMachineError` or `ThreadDeath`, this catch retains it and continues invoking arbitrary earlier hooks; a blocking hook can prevent the fatal condition from ever escaping. Rethrow JVM-fatal errors immediately and aggregate only nonfatal end-hook errors.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc773rdl","finding_digest":"c92b7c1747a290739ec238dd4ec3ebca21a44760e63e5f5597374768eeaf7d5f","finding_id":"arf_v1_zevxyf2hukihhhwchdou5q7lzi","finding_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::finalizeafterhandlerscopes::scope-fatal-observation-liveness","identity_key":"sdk/execution/durableexecutor::finalizeafterhandlerscopes::scope-fatal-observation-liveness","line":113,"observation_digest":"a3714eeab7ac4d62f3e9b9f3b2053da14277935ee37b7b56d14af6757eecef8f","observation_id":"aro_v1_unyu52vxvrgwf47jxhz3ebj5uf","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/plugin/PluginRunner.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_zevxyf2hukihhhwchdou5q7lzi","published_at":"2026-10-09T01:06:07Z","review_id":"arr_v1_vt34dnzhr72mh75qityehqrhqi","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"a43deba101516dc5a2fb5f51733728623cc57e1a","reviewer":"codex","start_line":113,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_k5tn7nxvygntqjjtyonxnphw4k","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-09T01:06:07Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
